    "%@ is turned off now. Removed from the list, it pauses your player again when it plays." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Apps: what removing an app that's turned off does, in its confirmation; %@ is the app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
