    "Allowed. Reopen AutoHush to start using it." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome window and Settings: Audio Recording was allowed in System Settings, which macOS applies at AutoHush's next launch",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
