    "AutoHush can’t hear %@ yet. Play a song, then click It’s Playing again." : {
      "comment" : "Under the step “Play a song in %@” after “It’s Playing” was clicked while the web app was silent; %@ is the web app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يسمع AutoHush %@ بعد. شغّل أغنية، ثم انقر على «قيد التشغيل» مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
